1
00:00:00,524 --> 00:00:04,484
(Dr Koothrappali:)But trust me,
you don't want it for a steady diet.

2
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:09,410
(Raj:)Now, you listen to me. I am no longer
a child and I will not be spoken to like one.

3
00:00:09,575 --> 00:00:12,575
Now, if you'll excuse me,
I have to go throw up.

4
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:17,080
- What's wrong with him?
PENNY: I don't know.

5
00:00:17,249 --> 00:00:19,839
(Penny:)Maybe it's the local cuisine.

6
00:00:23,755 --> 00:00:27,755
(Penny:)Okay, well, it's nice to meet you.

7
00:00:27,926 --> 00:00:30,426
(Penny:)Just gonna set you on down over here.

8
00:00:30,929 --> 00:00:34,349
And I'm gonna leave, so namaste.

9
00:00:37,436 --> 00:00:40,776
(Penny:)And FYI, you'd be lucky
to have me as a daughter-in-law.

10
00:00:43,025 --> 00:00:44,775
(Dr Koothrappali:)She's feisty.

11
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:46,773
(Dr Koothrappali:)I like that.

12
00:00:52,868 --> 00:00:55,158
[SHUFFLING]

13
00:00:57,539 --> 00:00:59,749
Raj, what are you doing?

14
00:01:03,045 --> 00:01:05,835
(Penny(opening door to find Raj outside):)No, no notes.
If you have something to say to me, say it.

15
00:01:20,979 --> 00:01:22,809
[IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE]
Sorry.

16
00:01:23,690 --> 00:01:26,820
(Penny:)Oh, sweetie, it's okay.

